  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following relations are correct?<br />(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p&#916;V</mi></math><br />(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>T&#916;S</mi></math><br />(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi>rev</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></math><br />(D) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#916;nRT</mi></math><br />Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
